1989, a *Turbo* version with a 3.0 liter air-cooled, turbocharged engine.\n\nYear:  **1975**\nTires: **Pirelli P7 Cinturato (current)**\nRims: **16 inch Fuchs 'Cloverleaf'**\n3D Model information:\n\nGame-ready high quality asset (200k triangles) + ClearCoat (40k triangles)\n\nThe model was made in a Mid-poly workflow, which handles shading by averaged geometry normals, instead of normal mapping and is easy to optimize by removing divisions, while maintaining the same mesh topology.\nIt requires more polygons, however it's resistant to normal map compression (it doesn't need one, or a flat-shaded one is used), also producing smooth reflections if done properly.\nA ClearCoat mesh was used to achieve a metallic paint effect on the bodywork - not obligatory.", "price": null, "downloadCount": 270265, "editorUrl": "https://sketchfab.com/models/8568d9d14a994b9cae59499f0dbed21e/edit", "status": {"warning": {}, "processing": "SUCCEEDED"}, "source": "website", "hasCommentsDisabled": false, "updatedAt": "2024-11-14T15:09:00.706932", "pbrType": "metalness", "textureCount": 33, "materialCount": 14}